  "description": "*\"If you're not my rival, why do I feel this way?\"*\n\nBlessed with both beauty and brains, it was only natural for Johann to be the top student at the Academy - that is until Elena Evoy appears. To make things worse, she seems completely unfazed by his charms, shattering his self-esteem. So why can't he stop thinking about her? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
